import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 502 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilization Rapid-Iteration Mechanism — Principles of Time-Flow-Rate Regulation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 502 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilization Rapid-Iteration Mechanism — Principles of Time-Flow-Rate Regulation","no":502,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Time Flow Rate","Law Resonance","Isolated Space","Causal Isolation"],"related":["16-Multiplication Fruit Technicalization Principle","13-Spatial-Legal Scheduling System Details","89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0502_模块3-本源加速域-时间流速调控原理.md","filePath":"en/0502_模块3-本源加速域-时间流速调控原理.md"}'),o={name:"en/0502_模块3-本源加速域-时间流速调控原理.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,u){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-502-origin-acceleration-domain-·-civilization-rapid-iteration-mechanism-—-principles-of-time-flow-rate-regulation" tabindex="-1">Entry 502 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilization Rapid-Iteration Mechanism — Principles of Time-Flow-Rate Regulation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-502-origin-acceleration-domain-·-civilization-rapid-iteration-mechanism-—-principles-of-time-flow-rate-regulation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 502 | Origin Acceleration Domain · Civilization Rapid-Iteration Mechanism — Principles of Time-Flow-Rate Regulation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 16, 13, 89</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-build-fast-on-the-law-not-on-predation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: build &quot;fast&quot; on the law, not on predation <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-build-fast-on-the-law-not-on-predation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: build &quot;fast&quot; on the law, not on predation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain is the dual-track time domain&#39;s &quot;fast&quot; track. It is not a metaphysical &quot;cultivation blessed spot,&quot; but an engineering system jointly supported by the Spatial-Legal Scheduling System (3rd Origin system) and Multiplication Fruit technology (Document 16). Six top-level axioms run through its design: anti-predation axiom requires acceleration energy come from law-resonance efficiency improvement, not devouring others&#39; lifespan; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the Acceleration Domain open to all beings with the capacity to bear it; collective ascension axiom requires acceleration-produced technology return to Myriad Ranks; causal self-discipline axiom requires strict causal isolation between Acceleration Domain and reality; law-first axiom requires each time-flow gear defined by law in advance, never temporary speed-up by plot. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article decomposes the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s lowest engineering principles: <strong>how is time flow actually sped up, and why does it not turn the people inside into idiots.</strong></p><h2 id="i-three-layer-principle-of-time-flow-rate-regulation" tabindex="-1">I. Three-Layer Principle of Time-Flow-Rate Regulation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-layer-principle-of-time-flow-rate-regulation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three-Layer Principle of Time-Flow-Rate Regulation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s time acceleration is not &quot;let everyone age a hundred times faster,&quot; but achieved through three layers of law operations:</p><ol><li><strong>Consciousness-Domain Frequency Enhancement Layer</strong>: drawing on Multiplication Fruit technology&#39;s &quot;consciousness acceleration&quot; principle (Document 16 §2), the entrant&#39;s consciousness computation frequency is boosted by gear. At hundredfold gear, one hundred seconds inside the consciousness domain corresponds to one second of reality. This layer is &quot;fast&quot; &#39;s core, because deduction, learning, and decision-making all happen in the consciousness domain.</li><li><strong>Energy-Supply Synchronization Layer</strong>: consciousness acceleration cannot come from nothing. Law-resonance devices pump environmental energy into the consciousness domain at the same ratio, ensuring computation has fuel. This layer strictly observes energy conservation — the extra energy comes from symbiotic-network incremental development, not extracted from other beings&#39; stock.</li><li><strong>Matter Time-Freezing Layer</strong>: body and external matter at default gear are &quot;time-frozen,&quot; not synchronously accelerated with consciousness. Otherwise, a cultivator in the Acceleration Domain for a hundred years would die of old age in the flesh first. This layer is the life-protection valve, and also the technical foundation for Entry 505&#39;s dedicated lifespan-balance discussion.</li></ol><p>Three layers superposed, the effect is: <strong>a person inside &quot;thinks&quot; for a hundred years, reality only passes one year, the body almost no wear.</strong> This is true &quot;efficiency amplification,&quot; not predatory &quot;lifespan theft.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-flow-rate-gears-and-admission-thresholds" tabindex="-1">II. Flow-Rate Gears and Admission Thresholds <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-flow-rate-gears-and-admission-thresholds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Flow-Rate Gears and Admission Thresholds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s flow rate is not a fixed value, but gear-adjustable; each gear has explicit admission thresholds:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Gear</th><th>Consciousness Multiplier</th><th>Max Single Duration</th><th>Admission Condition</th><th>Typical Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>10× Gear</td><td>10×</td><td>7 reality days</td><td>Sense Origin realm+ + real-name registration</td><td>Daily learning, cultivation-technique familiarization</td></tr><tr><td>100× Gear</td><td>100×</td><td>3 reality days</td><td>Condensed Origin realm+ + psychological assessment</td><td>R&amp;D deduction, bottleneck breakthrough</td></tr><tr><td>500× Gear</td><td>500×</td><td>12 reality hours</td><td>Transform Origin realm+ + ethics review</td><td>Major engineering deduction, crisis response</td></tr><tr><td>1000× Gear</td><td>1000×</td><td>1 reality hour</td><td>Law Origin realm+ + Anchor Supervisory Committee approval</td><td>Civilization-grade emergency deduction</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Gear design itself is anti-energy-waste embodiment: ordinary people using 10× gear is enough; no need to open 1000× gear for showing off; 1000× gear consumes extremely high law-resonance energy, reserved only for truly civilization-grade tasks.</p><h2 id="iii-causal-isolation-and-time-paradox-prevention" tabindex="-1">III. Causal Isolation and Time-Paradox Prevention <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-causal-isolation-and-time-paradox-prevention" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Causal Isolation and Time-Paradox Prevention&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Acceleration Domain&#39;s biggest risk is not &quot;people becoming stupid,&quot; but <strong>causal overheating.</strong> Deducting for a hundred years at hundredfold flow is equivalent to creating hundred times the causal bifurcations in isolated space. If these bifurcations are not isolated, they will echo back to the real plane like echoes, triggering the four time paradoxes described in Document 89.</p><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s solution is &quot;triple isolation&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Spatial isolation</strong>: the entire Acceleration Domain is built in an independent isolated space (Document 13), completely separated from the real plane by law barriers;</li><li><strong>Information isolation</strong>: entrants may not make any decision inside the Acceleration Domain that would directly affect the real causal chain; major decisions must be returned to reality for cooldown before execution;</li><li><strong>Return isolation</strong>: only abstract knowledge after information purification (Document 87 &quot;only knowledge is returned&quot;) is brought out of the Acceleration Domain, without any Acceleration-Domain matter, energy, or life-form.</li></ul><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors causal-bifurcation density throughout; once over threshold, automatically downshift or pause. This is the causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s engineering implementation in the time dimension.</p><h2 id="iv-essential-difference-from-predatory-time-acceleration" tabindex="-1">IV. Essential Difference From &quot;Predatory Time Acceleration&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-essential-difference-from-predatory-time-acceleration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Essential Difference From &quot;Predatory Time Acceleration&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old Myriad-Realms systems also have &quot;time acceleration,&quot; such as closed-door chambers, small worlds, senior towers. But those accelerations mostly built on predation: either consuming one faction&#39;s spirit veins, or using arrays to draw life force from a hundred-li radius, or simply the protagonist&#39;s exclusive cheat. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Origin Acceleration Domain differs in:</p><ul><li>Energy source is symbiotic-network-developed increment, not stock;</li><li>Admission is open registration, not bloodline or gift;</li><li>Output is public knowledge returned to Myriad Ranks, not protagonist&#39;s privately hoarded hole card;</li><li>Exit has cooldown and experience preservation; no &quot;enter with hot blood, exit as empty shell.&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: gear-based design puts every bit of law-resonance energy on the tasks most needing acceleration; eliminates energy idling from undifferentiated high-multiple acceleration</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: acceleration energy comes from incremental development and law resonance; does not draw others&#39; lifespan or seize other realms&#39; spirit veins</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s time-acceleration chamber only open to the protagonist and direct disciples; outsiders cannot even touch the door; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Acceleration Domain open to 99% Myriad Ranks; gear threshold is ability not bloodline</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five gene-lineage beings can all enter via adapted devices; energy-condensation races and consciousness-information races can even get higher initial gears</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: flow-rate regulation&#39;s law definitions, device blueprints, monitoring algorithms all public; any plane can self-build an Acceleration Domain per standards</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s &quot;fast&quot; is fast in the precise tuning of law, not fast in depriving others. Splitting time flow into three independently controllable variables — consciousness layer, energy layer, matter layer — then locking them into a safe cage with causal isolation — this is the underlying technology by which Anchor Symbiotic Civilization lets civilization &quot;rapidly iterate&quot; without collapsing. Fast, from now on, is an engineering, not a privilege.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">16-Multiplication Fruit Technicalization Principle</a> · <a href="./13-空间法理调度体系详解.html">13-Spatial-Legal Scheduling System Details</a> · <a href="./89-时间悖论防控机制.html">89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism</a> · <a href="./87-仅回传知识原则.html">87-Only-Knowledge-Returned Principle</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
